    "text": "WEAU-TV 13\nwebsite\nAugusta\nAugusta Athletics honors local Veteran’s ahead of Fourth of July\nBy WEAU Staff,1 hours ago\nAUGUSTA, Wis. (WEAU) - With Independence Day right around the corner, Augusta Athletics honored local veterans. Wednesday night, the Eau Claire Cavaliers played at Memorial Field in Augusta for veteran’s night. Those checking out the game also saw the color guard and a veteran’s recognition before the game with about 40 people going on the field for the national anthem and pledge of allegiance.\nComments\nLoading editor...",
